                                                "sense_id": "8ce0e7f2-4d53-3ff5-932c-91c6b36b7fdc",
                                                "text": "To cut coding time and to insure maintainability of the algorithms, an \"algorithm builder tool\" was constructed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47571c3b-a2f4-4974-bafe-5751df544be8",
                                                "sense_id": "8ce0e7f2-4d53-3ff5-932c-91c6b36b7fdc",
                                                "text": "A map builder uses map layers from several sources and adds data to make a custom map."
